 "stimulus_html": "Given the true statements <span data-math=\"p{:}\">p{:}</span> “A right triangle has one 90-degree angle,\" <span data-math=\"q{:}\">q{:}</span> \"The triangle is a right triangle,\" <span data-math=\"r{:}\">r{:}</span> \"<span data-math=\"{a^2} + {b^2} = {c^2},\">{a^2} + {b^2} = {c^2},</span>\" and  <span data-math=\"s{:}\">s{:}</span> \"The longest side of a triangle is <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> implies <span data-math=\"a + b\">a + b</span> must be <span data-math=\" > c\">&gt; c</span>.\" Write each of the following compound statements in symbolic form, then construct a truth table to determine the truth value of the  compound statement.",
